      "content": "The \"Friday afternoon\" thing is interesting. I've actually noticed a few of these entries popping up during shift changes or when the office is particularly chaotic. It’s almost like they are slipping through the cracks intentionally. If I want to catch the person or process responsible for these \"sneaky\" little transactions, should I focus more on cross-referencing the digital logs with physical receipt scans, or is there a better way to track these tiny, elusive amounts?",
